01-sima-near-ancestry","c-shiji-130-taishigong"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"high","identification_basis":{"kind":"source_context","target_mention_ids":["c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0068","c-shiji-130-taishigong:m001-0054"]},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry","source_id":"s-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001","quote":"宣皇帝諱懿，字仲達，河內溫縣孝敬里人，姓司馬氏。其先出自帝高陽之子重黎，為夏官祝融。歷唐、虞、夏、商，世序其職。及周，以夏官為司馬。其後程伯休父，周宣王時，以世官克平徐方，錫以官族，因而為氏。楚漢間，司馬卬為趙將，與諸侯伐秦。秦亡，立為殷王，都河內。漢以其地為郡，子孫遂家焉。自卬八世，生征西將軍鈞，字叔平。鈞生豫章太守量，字公度。量生潁川太守儁，字元異。儁生京兆尹防，字建公。帝即防之第二子也。少有奇節，聰朗多大略，博學洽聞，伏膺儒教。漢末大亂，常慨然有憂天下心。南陽太守同郡楊俊名知人，見帝，未弱冠，以為非常之器。尚書清河崔琰與帝兄朗善，亦謂朗曰：「君弟聰亮明允，剛斷英特，非子所及也。」"},{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-130","chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p001","quote":"昔在顓頊，命南正重以司天，北正黎以司地。唐虞之際，紹重黎之後，使復典之，至于夏商，故重黎氏世序天地。其在周，程伯休甫其後也。當周宣王時，失其守而為司馬氏。司馬氏世典周史。惠襄之閒，司馬氏去周適晉。晉中軍隨會奔秦，而司馬氏入少梁。"}],"rationale":"兩篇同在周宣王、司馬氏族源敘事中稱程伯休父／休甫，按專名、時代與情境暫辨同一史傳人物，保留原字。兩篇關於世官與得氏的說法各存，不由身份辨同裁定遠祖譜系。","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001","text":"宣皇帝諱懿，字仲達，河內溫縣孝敬里人，姓司馬氏。其先出自帝高陽之子重黎，為夏官祝融。歷唐、虞、夏、商，世序其職。及周，以夏官為司馬。其後程伯休父，周宣王時，以世官克平徐方，錫以官族，因而為氏。楚漢間，司馬卬為趙將，與諸侯伐秦。秦亡，立為殷王，都河內。漢以其地為郡，子孫遂家焉。自卬八世，生征西將軍鈞，字叔平。鈞生豫章太守量，字公度。量生潁川太守儁，字元異。儁生京兆尹防，字建公。帝即防之第二子也。少有奇節，聰朗多大略，博學洽聞，伏膺儒教。漢末大亂，常慨然有憂天下心。南陽太守同郡楊俊名知人，見帝，未弱冠，以為非常之器。尚書清河崔琰與帝兄朗善，亦謂朗曰：「君弟聰亮明允，剛斷英特，非子所及也。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"宣皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"懿","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"仲達","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"帝高陽","kind":"person","person_id":"2to_ofg_fuz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"重黎","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"傳說先祖語境，單名重黎或重、黎合稱須別核；楚世家重黎為火正祝融，自序另分南正重、北正黎，此處不憑字形自動合為同一人，也不接上古父子。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0068","start":68,"end":72,"surface":"程伯休父","kind":"person","person_id":"xgn_ado_9u1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0073","start":73,"end":76,"surface":"周宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"lt5_gcv_iqh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0100","start":100,"end":103,"surface":"司馬卬","kind":"person","person_id":"fdb_6pb_gux_***A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0139","start":139,"end":140,"surface":"卬","kind":"person","person_id":"fdb_6pb_gux_***A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0148","start":148,"end":149,"surface":"鈞","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"叔平","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0154","start":154,"end":155,"surface":"鈞","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0160","start":160,"end":161,"surface":"量","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0163","start":163,"end":165,"surface":"公度","kind":"person","perso